sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 管理员(浏览器)
    participant FE as 协议管理页(Vue)
    participant GW as 网关(Gateway)
    participant AC as AgreementController(admin-api)
    participant AS as AgreementService(admin-api)
    participant M as AgreementMapper(common)
    participant DB as t_agreement

    U->>FE: 选择类型/编辑HTML/点保存
    FE->>FE: 校验 title/contentHtml 非空且未超长
    FE->>GW: POST /api/admin/agreements (Bearer token)
    GW->>GW: 白名单不匹配 → 校验 JWT → 注入 X-User-Id
    GW->>AC: /admin/agreements
    AC->>AC: @PreAuthorize 角色校验(SUPER_ADMIN/MERCHANT_ADMIN)
    alt 无权限
        AC-->>FE: 403 (ApiResponse.error)
    else 通过
        AC->>AS: save(req, X-User-Id)
        AS->>M: selectOne(type)
        alt 已存在
            AS->>M: updateById(version+1, title, contentHtml, updatedBy)
        else 不存在
            AS->>M: insert(version=1, ...)
        end
        M->>DB: 写库(updated_at 自动刷新)
        AS-->>AC: Agreement(含新version/updatedAt)
        AC-->>GW: ApiResponse.success(Agreement)
        GW-->>FE: 200 {data: Agreement}
        FE-->>U: ElMessage.success("保存成功") + 刷新版本/时间
    end

---

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户(安卓)
    participant NF as NavGraph/入口页
    participant AG as AgreementScreen(Compose)
    participant API as ApiClient.getAgreement(type)
    participant GW as 网关(Gateway)
    participant UC as AgreementController(user-service)
    participant M as AgreementMapper(common)
    participant DB as t_agreement
    participant WV as WebView(AndroidView)

    U->>NF: 点击「隐私协议」→ navigate("agreement/privacy")
    NF->>AG: AgreementScreen(navController, type="privacy")
    AG->>AG: LaunchedEffect → 调 API
    AG->>API: GET /api/user/agreements/privacy (无 token)
    API->>GW: 请求
    GW->>GW: 白名单匹配 /api/user/agreements GET → 放行
    GW->>UC: /user/agreements/privacy
    UC->>UC: 校验 type ∈ {about,privacy,register}
    UC->>M: selectOne(type)
    M->>DB: 查询
    DB-->>M: Agreement
    UC-->>GW: ApiResponse.success(AgreementVO)
    GW-->>API: 200
    API-->>AG: AgreementVO
    AG->>AG: 拼装 HTML = CSS模板 + contentHtml
    AG->>WV: loadDataWithBaseURL(BASE_URL, html, ...)
    WV-->>U: 渲染协议（图片/链接可点）
    AG-->>U: 顶部标题栏 + 底部「更新于 updatedAt vVersion」
